>
> Simpy download it and open in some pdf reader. i have no idea why Chrome
> doesn't want to render it.
>
>
Yep, I know that. However I wonder how many new users would go through the
extra steps. I guess many will just click and assume that the file is
damaged if it doesn't open as they expect.



>
> Why did you welcome PEG?
>

Because it is simpler than the CLL YACC grammar. I know how difficult is to
be sure that a PEG grammar does exactly what one expects it does, but (at
least for me) YACC grammars are even more difficult to understand (and
maintain/modify/extend).

